{"id": "69340", "title": "愚人的国度", "author": "王不难/王宝宝", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 19, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69340.htm", "intro": "他是愚人，她叫国度。她，是“愚人”的国度。\r\n总有一个人在你身边情不自禁的原意为你做任何事，不求回报。\r\n国度是个会为了自己梦想不顾一切的傻姑娘，她对他说：“你知道梦想是什么吗？梦想是你永远都抵达不了的世界。你，是没梦想的人！你，真可怜！”\r\n是，在她眼里，他就是个只知道挥霍的花花公子、二世祖、纨绔子弟……也许还有更难听的，他不在乎。\r\n他有时候也觉得自己可怜，因为，他的梦想就在眼前却不能说，他此生的梦想——只愿为她做“愚人”。\r\n\r\n内容标签：都市情缘 天之骄子 情有独钟", "base": "files/article/html/69/69340", "chapters": [{"title": "Part【1】", "file": "10615093.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Part【2】", "file": "10615094.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Part【3】", "file": "10615095.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Part【4】", "file": "10615096.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Part【5】", "file": "10615097.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Part【6】", "file": "10615098.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Part【7】", "file": "10615099.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Part【8】", "file": "10615100.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Part【9】", "file": "10615101.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Part【10】", "file": "10615102.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Part【11】", "file": "10615103.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Part【12】", "file": "10615104.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Part【13】", "file": "10615105.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Part【14】", "file": "10615106.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15-17", "file": "10615107.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18-20", "file": "10615108.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-24", "file": "10615109.html", "available": false}, {"title": "25-28", "file": "10615110.html", "available": false}, {"title": "29-30完结", "file": "10615111.html", "available": false}]}